# Everything here is stored and checked out with LF.
#
# The committed blobs already were LF; what this fixes is the working tree.
# oxfmt writes LF and checks for it, and a Windows clone under the default
# core.autocrlf=true gets CRLF on disk -- so `npm run fmt:check` failed on
# every source file there while passing in CI, and `npm run fmt` rewrote all
# of them into a diff git then showed as empty. See "Line endings" in
# AGENTS.md.
* text=auto eol=lf
